{% extends 'site/base_public.html.twig' %}

{# THE CANONICAL PAGE FOR ONE LOAN OBJECT (S133).

   Every card on `/prets` used to link to `/prets` — clicking an object reloaded
   the page you were standing on. There was nowhere for it to go; this is that
   somewhere, and the two admin lists point here as well, so "the object" means
   one address whichever list you came from.

   🔴 **S151 — cette page était la SEULE page publique sans barre de navigation.**
   Elle étendait `base.html.twig`, la coquille nue : celle-ci n'a ni bloc `header`
   ni `{% include 'site/_header.html.twig' %}`, seulement un `{% block body %}` et
   un pied de page. Les 39 autres gabarits qui l'étendent sont des écrans admin ou
   staff, et eux reçoivent l'en-tête par `_admin_list.html.twig` ; celui-ci
   n'incluait rien. Un membre qui ouvrait un objet prêtable perdait le menu et
   n'avait que le fil d'Ariane pour repartir.
   ⚠️ **Le pied de page, lui, était bien là** — d'où « le menu disparaît » et non
   « la page est nue ». Balayage de 29 pages publiques : c'était la seule.
   ⚠️ Les trois blocs utilisés ici — `title`, `stylesheets`, `body` — existent des
   deux côtés, donc le changement de parent n'en oriente aucun ailleurs.

   ⚠️ **No local `<style>`.** `_breadcrumb`, `_cell_state` and `_cell_meter` come
   from `components.css`, which the shell emits everywhere; `.ml-page` /
   `.ml-wrap` and the four `.loan-item*` rules live in `machines-list.css`, linked
   below exactly as `/places` and `/materials` link it. ⚠️ **Not
   `.readonly-grid`** — that grid is defined in `admin.css`, which a public page
   never loads, and using it here would have printed an unstyled definition list.
   That is the shared-partial cascade trap, three times found and recorded in
   `/admin/design#recherche`. #}

{% block title %}{{ item.name }} - FabOS{% endblock %}

{% block stylesheets %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('css/machines-list.css') ~ '?v=20260903-s159' }}">
{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="ml-page">
    <div class="ml-wrap">
        {% include 'site/_breadcrumb.html.twig' with {trail: [
            {label: 'nav.home'|trans, url: path('app_home')},
            {label: 'nav.loans'|trans, url: path('app_loans')},
            {label: item.name},
        ]} only %}

        <article class="loan-item">
            {% if item.imageUrl %}
                <img class="loan-item__photo" src="{{ item.imageUrl }}" alt="{{ item.name }}">
            {% endif %}

            <div class="loan-item__body">
                <h1>{{ item.name }}</h1>

                <p class="loan-item__states">
                    {% if item.archived %}
                        {# Not a 404. Someone arriving from their own loan history is
                           asking about a thing that existed; saying "retired" is an
                           answer, and "no such page" is not. #}
                        {% include 'site/_cell_state.html.twig' with {
                            label: 'loans.item_archived'|trans, signal: 'muted',
                        } only %}
                    {% else %}
                        {% include 'site/_cell_state.html.twig' with {
                            label: (free > 0 ? 'state.available' : 'state.borrowed')|trans,
                            signal: free > 0 ? 'go' : 'wait',
                        } only %}
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if item.category %}
                        {% include 'site/_cell_state.html.twig' with {label: item.category, signal: 'muted'} only %}
                    {% endif %}
                </p>

                {% if item.description %}<p class="loan-item__desc">{{ item.description }}</p>{% endif %}

                <dl class="loan-item__facts">
                    <div>
                        <dt>{{ 'adm.col_available'|trans }}</dt>
                        <dd>{% include 'site/_cell_meter.html.twig' with {
                            value: free, max: item.quantity, signal: free > 0 ? 'go' : 'stop',
                        } only %}</dd>
                    </div>
                    {% if item.storageLocation %}
                        <div>
                            <dt>{{ 'adm.col_storage'|trans }}</dt>
                            <dd>{{ item.storageLocation }}</dd>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if item.venue %}
                        <div>
                            <dt>{{ 'venue_context.menu'|trans }}</dt>
                            <dd>{{ item.venue.name }}</dd>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                </dl>

                {# ⚠️ No "borrow" button, and that is not an omission: checkouts are
                   recorded by staff at the desk (`/admin/prets/nouveau`). A control
                   here would be the dead affordance this page exists to remove. #}
                <p class="loan-item__note">{{ 'loans.item_desk_note'|trans }}</p>
            </div>
        </article>
    </div>
</main>
{% endblock %}
